This directory vendors ENet 1.3.18 (https://github.com/lsalzman/enet), lightly
adapted to build as a SwiftPM C target. The upstream copyright notice below was
missing from this copy and has been restored: ENet's licence requires it to be
included with the source, and removing it was an oversight rather than a
decision.

Sunshine and moonlight-common-c both use ENet for the GameStream control channel,
which is why the client needs it.

